{"question": "Trong vận động chuyển động trước bên của hàm dưới, răng nào gây nhả khớp tất cả các răng sau?", "claim": "Trong vận động chuyển động trước bên, răng nanh gây nhả khớp tất cả các răng sau, hiện tượng này gọi là hướng dẫn răng nanh.", "internal_evidence": [{"evidence_id": "I1", "content": "Trong các vận động chuyển động trước bên của hàm dưới, răng nanh đóng vai trò chủ đạo trong việc tạo ra hiện tượng hướng dẫn răng nanh, dẫn đến kết quả là gây nhả khớp hoàn toàn tất cả các răng phía sau ở cả hai bên cung răng."}], "public_quote_options": [{"quote_id": "P1.Q1", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Table 1
Sociodemographic and general health characteristics of participants (n = 1064).
Characteristic | n | %"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q2", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Demographics"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q3", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Age
>50 years | 60 | 5.6"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q4", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Gender"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q5", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Education level"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q6", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Marital status"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q7", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Survey communication method"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q8", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "General health status"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q9", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Self-reported general health"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q10", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Self-reported weight status"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q11", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Self-reported chronic systemic diseases and related health conditions"}, {"quote_id": "P1.Q12", "evidence_id": "P1", "text": "Regular intake of medications"}, {"quote_id": "P2.Q1", "evidence_id": "P2", "text": "Source control was provided according to disease severity. Patients with fluctuant abscess formation or progressive deep space infection underwent surgical incision, decompression, and drainage under local or general anesthesia, with extraction of the offending tooth when indicated. Patients who presented in the early cellulitic phase without evidence of drainable pus were managed conservatively with intravenous antibiotics, supportive care, and close airway observation."}, {"quote_id": "P3.Q1", "evidence_id": "P3", "text": "A quantitative meta-analysis was not undertaken due to substantial clinical and methodological heterogeneity among the included studies. Specifically, studies differed in the biological matrix analysed (subgingival biofilm vs saliva), detection platforms employed (qPCR, 16S rRNA sequencing, HOMIM, and checkerboard DNA–DNA hybridisation), and case definitions used to classify periodontitis and disease severity (the 1999 AAP framework versus the 2018 EFP/AAP staging system). In addition, outcome reporting varied between prevalence, relative abundance, and correlation with clinical parameters, limiting effect-size harmonisation. Given these differences, a qualitative synthesis was considered the most appropriate to summarise the available evidence without introducing misleading quantitative estimates."}], "public_sources": [{"evidence_id": "P1", "title": "Prevalence and determinants of self-reported halitosis in Saudi Arabia: a nationwide cross-sectional study", "heading_path": ["Body", "Results", "Participant characteristics and prevalence of self-reported halitosis"]}, {"evidence_id": "P2", "title": "Ludwig’s angina in Somalia: clinical characteristics, emergency management, and outcomes from a tertiary academic referral center", "heading_path": ["Body", "Materials and methods", "Clinical management"]}, {"evidence_id": "P3", "title": "Association between Eubacterium saphenum and periodontitis: A systematic review", "heading_path": ["Body", "4. Discussion", "4.4. Justification of no meta-analysis"]}]}
